sequenceDiagram
    participant U as Usuario / Frontend
    participant W as Vista Django
    participant C as Cola Celery
    participant K as Worker Celery
    participant T as Task process_network_plan
    participant E as AwsProviderExecutor
    participant TF as Terraform CLI

    U->>W: POST /deploy/
    W->>C: process_network_plan.delay(...)
    W-->>U: 202 Accepted + task_id
    C->>K: entrega tarea
    K->>T: ejecuta process_network_plan(...)
    T->>E: build_bundle(...)
    T->>E: prepare_workspace(...)
    T->>E: terraform_init(...)
    E->>TF: terraform init
    T->>E: terraform_plan(...)
    E->>TF: terraform plan
    T->>E: terraform_apply(...) si aplica
    E->>TF: terraform apply
    T-->>K: resultado + logs + outputs
